IzMac charge control builds on knowledge from, and partly adapts, these open-source projects.
IzMac itself is GPL-3.0-or-later (see LICENSE).

OpenDente (https://github.com/killerk3emstar/OpenDente), GPL-3.0.
  Used for: the SMC parameter struct layout, call flow (key info, read, write), key detection
  between CHTE/CHIE and CH0B/CH0C/CH0I, and the ACLC LED values. Adapted in Sources/IzMac/SMC.swift.

Battery-Toolkit (https://github.com/mhaeuser/Battery-Toolkit), BSD 3-Clause License.
  Used for: key sizes and byte values for CHTE, CHIE, CH0J, CH0C and ACLC, the readback check after
  a write. Adapted in Sources/IzMac/SMC.swift and Sources/IzMac/Daemon.swift.

